These are extracted and modified source templates. Java literal expressions and
static defaults were decoded, PostgreSQL XML overrides were applied, SQLStmt
placeholder lists were expanded using declared defaults, and JDBC bind markers
were converted to PostgreSQL occurrence-numbered parameters outside quoted SQL
and comments. Per-record transformations and original SQL are retained.

The selected workloads are SmallBank, TATP, TPC-C, TPC-H, Twitter and YCSB.
The extraction is not a claim of compliance with official TPC benchmarks or a
performance result. No upstream program or SQL statement was executed by the
extractor. Runtime parameter values, transaction schedules and loaders are not
included. Mutable static fields use their source initializer defaults only.
